      "instance_name": "woman_in_wheelchair_scene",
      "label": "woman_in_wheelchair",
      "description": "A woman in a blue wheelchair is positioned centrally in a studio setting with a plain white background. She is looking directly at the camera with a neutral to slightly pensive expression, her arms crossed over her chest. The scene is overlaid with the text 'i wish i could stand by you!'. The composition emphasizes her physical presence and the contrast between her seated posture and the metaphorical phrase.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
